{"id":29,"date":"2026-03-16T13:49:48","date_gmt":"2026-03-16T13:49:48","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/?page_id=29"},"modified":"2026-03-23T11:46:49","modified_gmt":"2026-03-23T11:46:49","slug":"colleges","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/colleges\/","title":{"rendered":"Colleges"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"alignleft size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"444\" height=\"133\" src=\"http:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/updated-logo-2023-for-firstdorm.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8\" srcset=\"https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/updated-logo-2023-for-firstdorm.png 444w, https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/updated-logo-2023-for-firstdorm-300x90.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 444px) 100vw, 444px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><br>A Partnership Model with Colleges that works<\/h1>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"558\" src=\"http:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/DOUBLE-HEIGHT-SPACE-1-1024x558.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-181\" srcset=\"https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/DOUBLE-HEIGHT-SPACE-1-1024x558.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/DOUBLE-HEIGHT-SPACE-1-300x163.jpg 300w, https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/DOUBLE-HEIGHT-SPACE-1-768x418.jpg 768w, https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/DOUBLE-HEIGHT-SPACE-1-1536x837.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/DOUBLE-HEIGHT-SPACE-1-2048x1116.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">FirstDorm&#8217;s Partnership that Works<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">We forge long-term, holistic partnerships with colleges \u2014 funding, designing, building, renovating, and managing student residences, all at a ZERO Cost<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u2713 Zero Capex<br>\u2713 Zero Opex<br>\u2713 Zero Financial Burden<br>\u2713 Zero Headaches<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">FirstDorm&#8217;s Offering to Colleges<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">New Hostel Development : Building for Tomorrow<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We design and construct cutting-edge student residences from the ground up \u2014 spaces that inspire, comfort, and prepare students for the future.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">What we deliver:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Contemporary architecture and design<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sustainable, net-zero energy buildings<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tech-enabled infrastructure<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Optimal space utilization<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Future-ready amenities<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Retrofit &amp; Upgrade Existing Hostels : Breathing New Life into Old Hostels<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Most existing hostels need transformation, not replacement. We specialize in converting outdated facilities into modern, desirable living spaces.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our retrofit process:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Structural assessment<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Modern redesign<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Complete furnishing\/furbishing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Technology integration<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sustainability upgrades<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Captive Off-Campus Hostels<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For institutions needing additional capacity, we acquire land and build dedicated student residences near your campus \u2014 ensuring quality housing without campus constraints.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Operations &amp; Management : Invisible when things run smoothly. Present when it matters.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Professional management that enhances student life while freeing your team.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We manage:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>24\/7 security and access control<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Regular housekeeping<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Maintenance and repairs<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Dining and meal services<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Student engagement programs<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Wellness and mental health support<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Emergency response<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">How the Partnership Works<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">We Invest<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">FirstDorm funds the design, construction, upgrading, furnishing, and long\u2011term management of student housing. For captive off\u2011campus hostels, we also acquire the land.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">You Provide<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Land or existing hostel assets (for on\u2011campus projects)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Student demand assurance (typically ~90% occupancy for on\u2011campus and captive off\u2011campus models)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Together, We Win<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Modern student housing at zero cost, happier students, improved enrollment appeal, and a stronger institutional brand.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What Changes on Your Campus<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Students thrive in contemporary, sustainable living environments<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Faculty take pride in a campus that rivals the best in India<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Leadership is recognized for innovation\u2014without financial strain<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Housing stops being a constraint. It becomes a competitive advantage.<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">More Than Hostels<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>We don\u2019t just build accommodation.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>We co\u2011create living and learning ecosystems where students belong, grow, and carry your institution\u2019s legacy forward.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Rooted in deep listening. Designed around your constraints and aspirations. Built to last.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Zero Capex. Zero Headaches.<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Rising construction costs. Evolving student expectations. Outdated housing models.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>What was once a side issue is now central to enrollment, outcomes, and reputation.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>FirstDorm becomes your <em>nimit matra<\/em>\u2014the right instrument\u2014to make your institutional vision inevitable.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Let\u2019s Build the Future of Student Living<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>If you believe your institution is destined for more\u2014and your campus should reflect that ambition\u2014we should talk.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">FirstDorm offers colleges a transformation everyone wants, but few can execute <em>at zero cost to you.<\/em><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-fe48e5de wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-theme-palette-12-background-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/contact\/\">Partner with FirstDorm<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>A Partnership Model with Colleges that works FirstDorm&#8217;s Partnership that Works We forge long-term, holistic partnerships with colleges \u2014 funding, designing, building, renovating, and managing student residences, all at a ZERO Cost \u2713 Zero Capex\u2713 Zero Opex\u2713 Zero Financial Burden\u2713 Zero Headaches FirstDorm&#8217;s Offering to Colleges New Hostel Development : Building for Tomorrow We design&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking":false,"_monsterinsights_sitenote_active":false,"_monsterinsights_sitenote_note":"","_monsterinsights_sitenote_category":0,"_kad_post_transparent":"enable","_kad_post_title":"hide","_kad_post_layout":"normal","_kad_post_sidebar_id":"","_kad_post_content_style":"","_kad_post_vert